{"id": "civic_indiagovin_557c6107_01", "source_url": "https://www.india.gov.in/", "title": "Home | National Portal of India", "section": "Overview", "text": "India's Digital Public Infrastructure has demonstrated how technology can expand opportunity, improve governance, boost financial inclusion and deliver services for hundreds of millions of people. India's Digital Public Infrastructure has demonstrated how technology can expand opportunity, improve governance, boost financial inclusion and deliver services for hundreds of millions of people. In accordance with the legal mandate under Section 162 of the Motor Vehicles (MV) Act, 1988, the \"Prime Minister - Road Accident Victims' Hospitalisation and Assured Treatment (PM-RAHAT) Scheme\" has been notified vide S.O. 2015(E) dated 05.05.2025. Further, comprehensive guidelines detailing the process flow, roles and responsibilities of respective stakeholders, and the Standard Operating Procedures (SOP) for its implementation have been issued vide S.O. 2489(E) dated 04.06.2025. The scheme was launched by the Prime Minister on 13.02.2026 and has been named the Prime Minister - Road Accident Victims' Hospitalisation and Assured Treatment (PM-RAHAT) Scheme vide S.O. 952(E) dated 19.02.2026.", "category": "civic", "last_verified": "2026-10-25", "status": "verified", "quality_score": 0.92, "source_confidence": "official", "verification_method": "automated_official_source", "retrieval_tags": ["guideline", "indiagovin", "procedure", "process", "scheme", "service"], "language": "en"}
{"id": "civic_indiagovin_cecc107b_01", "source_url": "https://www.india.gov.in/category/citizenship-visa-passports", "title": "National Portal of India - Loading...Citizenship, Visa & PassportsCovering India’s diplomatic engagements, this section provides detailed information on visa and passport services and offers support for Indians living abroad.", "section": "Overview", "text": "Citizenship, Visa & Passports Covering India’s diplomatic engagements, this section provides detailed information on visa and passport services and offers support for Indians living abroad. Subcategories Living / Travelling abroad Traveling provides quick cultural exposure and flexibility, while living abroad offers deep local engagement, including challenges like housing and groceries, turning a new place into a second home. Associated Ministries /Departments News / Releases - PIB15-10-2026 | 16:46:00 PMPassport Seva Mobile Van Camp at Gopalganj, Bihar - PIB15-10-2026 | 10:47:00 AMOPEN HOUSE CONDUCTED TO ADDRESS PASSPORT APPLICATIONS PENDING ON OR BEFORE 31st DECEMBER 2025", "category": "civic", "last_verified": "2026-10-25", "status": "verified", "quality_score": 0.92, "source_confidence": "official", "verification_method": "automated_official_source", "retrieval_tags": ["citizen", "indiagovin", "info", "service"], "language": "en"}
