{"id": "civic_wcdhrygovin_1603115d_01", "source_url": "https://wcdhry.gov.in/", "title": "Homepage | Women and Child Development Department, Haryana | India", "section": "Overview", "text": "- Hon'ble Chief Minister Sh. Nayab Singh Saini - Hon'ble Minister WCD Smt. Shruti Choudhry - Commissioner & Secretary Sh. Shekhar Vidyarthi, IAS - Director Dr. Priyanka Soni, IAS About Department The Directorate of Women and Child Development is functioning w.e.f. 01-04-1992 vide notification No. 79-SW I/92 dated 10th February,1992 after getting bifurcation from social welfare department. In its capacity as a nodal agency looking after the advancement of women and children, the Department formulates plans, policies and programs and coordinates the efforts of both government and non-governmental organizations working in the field of women and child development. The Department and its constituents organizations work in close co-operation with the social organizations and international agencies like UNICEF, World Bank, UNFPA etc. to achieve the goals of development of women and children. The Department is implementing various schemes for overall development of women and children under state, central and with assistance of international agencies. women and child development. The Department and its constituents organizations work in close co-operation with the social organizations and international agencies like UNICEF, World Bank, UNFPA etc… Read More", "category": "civic", "last_verified": "2026-10-25", "status": "verified", "quality_score": 0.92, "source_confidence": "official", "verification_method": "automated_official_source", "retrieval_tags": ["about", "scheme", "wcdhrygovin"], "language": "en"}
