ersons for Purchase/Fitting of Aids and Appliances (ADIP Scheme), Deendayal Disabled Rehabilitation Scheme to promote voluntary action for persons with Disabilities (DDRS Scheme), National Awards and National Scholarships for persons with disabilities, Trust Fund for empowerment of persons with disabilities and schemes arising out of the implementation of related programmes | Women and Child Development Department | Click here | | 8 | Job Seeker Registration | Online registration facility provided by the State / UT for the job seekers - register by providing necessary details. | Labour, Skill Development and Employment Department | Click here | | 9 | Employer Registration | Online registration of employer with the department to avail the facility of finding the right candidate to fill vacancies by the posting of job vacancies and searching the candidate database for suitable resumes | Labour, Skill Development and Employment Department | Click here | | 10 | Job Skill Development | Enhancing skills through institutional training, infrastructure, convergence, trainers, overseas employment, sustainable livelihoods and leveraging public infrastructure | Labour, Skill Development and Employment Department | — | | 11 | [MISSING", "category": "civic", "last_verified": "2026-10-25", "status": "verified", "quality_score": 0.92, "source_confidence": "official", "verification_method": "automated_official_source", "retrieval_tags": ["citizen", "grievance", "guideline", "gujaratindiagovin", "process", "registration", "scheme"], "language": "en"}
