{"id": "civic_communigujaratgovin_f7866693_01", "source_url": "https://communi.gujarat.gov.in/Home/AboutUs", "title": "communi.gujarat.gov.in - About Us", "section": "Overview", "text": "About Us Commissioner of Municipalities Administration, Gandhinagar, Gujarat Commissioner of Municipalities Administration, who shall subject to the control of the state Government exercise such powers, duties and functions conferred under the provision of Gujarat Municipalities Act, 1963. Under the control of Commissioner total six Regional Commissioner, Municipalities (Ahmedabad, Gandhinagar, Vadodara, Surat, Rajkot & Bhavnagar) shall exercise powers and perform function and duties. Administrative, Supervision and Controlling Authority:- - Administration and Management of Municipalities. - Approval of rules under section 271 and bye laws under section 275. - Supervision of Municipalities functioning and activities. - Vigilance and inquiry for Municipalities misconduct and misbehavior. - Monitoring of special drives declared by the state government. Classification of Municipalities :- As per the Census 2011, total 150 Municipalities are functioning in Gujarat State, which are broadly categorized as under. Classification | Classification | Population | Total Muncipalities | |---|---|---| | A-Class | More than 1 Lac | 37 | | B-Class | 50,000 to 1,00,000 | 34 | | C-Class | 25,000 to 50,000 | 62 | | D-Class | 15,000 to 25,000 | 17 | | Total | | 150 | Quasi Judicial Work:- - Section 37 : Authority to Remove Councilor, President & Vice-president if he has been guilty of misconduct in the discharge of duties or of any disgraceful conduct or has become incapable of performing his duties. - Section 70 : Authority to recover the economical loss personally from Councilor, President & Vice-president if he has been guilty of misuse of finance. - Section 258 (3) : Appellant Authority against Order of Collector. - Section 38 (4) : Appellant Authority against Order of Collector. - Section 40 : Authority to remove President & Vice-president.", "category": "civic", "last_verified": "2026-10-25", "status": "verified", "quality_score": 0.92, "source_confidence": "official", "verification_method": "automated_official_source", "retrieval_tags": ["about", "communigujaratgovin", "rules"], "language": "en"}
